Aut is a humanoid with completely white skin. He has oversized hands and feet, but unnaturally gangly, thin arms and legs. His torso is a simple cylinder. His head is perfectly spherical, overly large, and has absolutely no facial features expect for a giant toothy grin that stretches from one side of his face to the other.

He makes a habit of observing the world, and nudging it in the direction he prefers through his "friends." The recent advent of the [[Voidsong]] has somehow disrupted his ability, however, much to his chagrin. He lives somewhere within the [[Geography/Black and White/index|Black and White]].

When Johnny Skyfall and Benny died at the [[Geography/Calaria/Hallia/Sableclutch/The Crowded Flea|Crowded Flea]], they met Aut in the empty space between [[Færrin]] and the [[Godhome]]. He told them that when people of Færrin die, their souls enter the [[Pharos]] and float up to the Godhome, and that this is the only way there. Because they had not come through the Pharos he would not let them into it from where they were, and instead pushed them back to the place they had died; each of them left a little of himself behind, whole but unable to grow, to be picked up later by returning through the Pharos. He set a mark on them, three blue dots in a triangle, which they can bring out or hide at will and which shows itself on its own to anyone who has already seen it. He said he can predict everything and cannot predict them, and blamed that on the Voidsong. He asked them to say hello to his friends at 13 Bright Street when they met them.
